  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A lot of the time the fun can be completely ruined by a 9 year old who runs up and just acts rude for the sake of being rude, tried joining any Murder lobbies lately? Well I have, and it's just filled with children who harrass you. The quest platform is great, but it also brings way to many children to the table, where the sensible people would rather not have them. \n\nTherefore I suggest that there is a feature in which you can choose what kind of lobby you want to create when you make it, so you can choose server location already, why not let us choose which platform to limit the lobby to too? I find this would make a lot of people happy as it is nobodies wish to be constantly harrassed by a bunch of minors screaming derogatory slurs.",
